00:24.760 --> 00:27.920
Because here we are extracting the name of the date part.

00:27.960 --> 00:31.560
And if you go and use the date trunk you will get in the output.

00:31.560 --> 00:33.480
Always date time two.

00:33.520 --> 00:35.720
So you are getting both the date and time.

